WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:08.550
It seems certain now that Sayaka
Nakasugi is infected with the Ryunka.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:14.190
We confirmed the Ryunka's data in
our analysis of the sample you took.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:19.000
Captain Megius, is there
really no way to save the host?

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.070
I understand how you feel,
Birdy, but we're out of time.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.200
I'm sure the pontiffs will
begin disposal of the Ryunka

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.670
as soon as they arrive on Earth.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:33.540
No doubt they're willing to allow
any amount of damage to the planet.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.250
If you care about Earth...

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.250
Tsutomu?

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:41.380
Oh, I guess we're on the
spaceship. Is something wrong?

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:42.890
Um, Tsutomu...

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.060
Perfect timing. There's something
we need to tell you, Tsutomu.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.520
- Uh, okay.
- Captain!

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.730
Tsutomu, we've finished restoration of your body.

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:54.530
Huh?

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.870
Oh, sweet!

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.340
Wait, Birdy, aren't you happy?

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:04.510
O-Of course I'm happy. That's great, Tsutomu.

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:05.910
That's great...

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:51.280
Sweet! Freedom is a
wonderful thing! Right, Birdy?

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.280
What's wrong with you, Birdy?

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.820
Listen, Tsutomu...

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:58.390
You're pretty gloomy
considering we finally got our bodies back.

00:02:58.390 --> 00:03:01.360
The thing is, Tsutomu, the Ryunka...

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.330
Huh?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.160
Nakasugi is the Ryunka!

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.300
Tsutomu...

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:12.340
That's a lie! That's a <i>lie!</i>

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.540
I can't tell him.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.040
Hmm? What is it, Birdy?

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:22.410
Right now I'll calmly listen
to anything you have to say.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.180
You're looking mighty relaxed
for the first day of the semester.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.520
Oh, Hayamiya, it's just you.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.390
Well? How was your date?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.690
You better not have jumped Nakasugi!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.260
Don't be ridiculous!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.060
I'm suspicious.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.400
Maybe I'll ask her when she gets here.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.530
Don't do that!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.430
What are you panicking for? Totally suspicious!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.170
Hey! This is...

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.870
Hayamiya!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.270
Isn't this Nakasugi's grandpa?

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.050
Hey, the opening ceremony is about to start!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.450
I'm leaving early!

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:05.590
As you can see, traffic is blocked
off in front of the Nakasugi home,

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:09.090
and the scene is one of turmoil.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.130
The murderer has yet to be apprehended,

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.730
and all eyes will be on the police as they respond.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.600
Excuse me! Please let me through!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.770
Hold it! You can't come through here.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.870
Sir, how is Sayaka Nakasugi?

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.700
Hey, you! Keep out!

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:35.820
- Hello?!
- The customer you have
dialed is either out of range

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:38.450
or has powered off their phone.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.760
I can't believe this...

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.260
He seemed so nice...

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.100
Hey, look at that!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.670
"The Nakasugi family servant
has been missing since the attack,

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:54.840
and is being sought as a person of interest."

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.940
Yoshie Suzuki?

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.770
Her?

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.170
I wonder if Nakasugi is okay...

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.290
Something's wrong here.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.190
Huh?

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:20.660
Why do all these weird things
keep happening around Nakasugi?

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:24.300
Maybe she's mixed up in something.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.500
Tsutomu... Listen, the truth is...

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.940
Hey, look!

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.540
Nakasugi.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.820
Tsutomu...

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:45.790
Birdy, please... Is it okay if we
come here for another few days?

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:46.790
What?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.830
I want to protect Nakasugi.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:56.700
So if it looks like she's in danger,
I'd like your help.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.570
Please, Birdy! I'm begging you!

00:05:58.570 --> 00:05:59.870
Hey, stop that!

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:02.140
Please, Birdy!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.130
Tsutomu...

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:32.700
So did you get in touch with Nakasugi?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:35.740
It's no good. I can't get
through on her home phone either.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:37.240
It's still rough on her.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.540
Yeah...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.840
There's a press mob over there, after all.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:44.250
Senkawa's acting funny, too.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.680
He's been like that all day.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:49.280
He's just got vacation hangover. Forget about him.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:55.390
Come on, Tsutomu, it's been
three days. You're at your limit.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.690
It's okay. Just a little longer.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:00.700
But is the Ryunka thing gonna be okay?

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.030
W-Well, the investigation's still stuck.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:09.970
Oh. But let me know if you
find anything out. I'll help.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:15.310
I probably can't do anything,
but I know we have to find it soon.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.550
Tsutomu...

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:21.050
Jeez, you sound as beat as I do.

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:25.420
Come to think of it, what will you
do when you catch the Ryunka?

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.820
I'll dispose of it.

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:32.390
"Dispose"? Oh, you mean kill it?

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:36.100
Then what happens to the person it's possessing?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.730
Won't they die, too?

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:40.400
I don't want that either!

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:44.000
I'm not blaming you.
I mean, there's no choice, right?

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.270
What a sucky job...

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:59.020
Nakasugi Industrial Technologies
is now holding a funeral,

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:03.650
but there's been no progress in
Katsutoshi Nakasugi's murder case.

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.160
Shyamalan...

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.980
No way.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:37.890
Senkawa...

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.630
Tsutomu.

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:46.900
Tsutomu! This is enough, right?

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.070
Let's call it quits.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.510
Just a little longer.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:56.080
I want to watch over her until I get to talk to her.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:09:01.320
Say, Tsutomu, there's something I need to tell you.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.320
Huh? What is it?

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:04.420
Don't be too shocked, okay?

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:05.890
What <i>is</i> it?

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:10.430
The truth is, I know where the Ryunka is.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:13.560
It's infected Nakasugi!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:16.900
So I need to...

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:18.270
I'm sorry.

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:21.370
Tsutomu? Huh?!

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:25.570
Hey! You're sleeping at the key moment?!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.510
I guess there's no helping it.

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:43.060
Huh?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.760
Oh, crap!

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:48.060
I have to get back to Nakasugi, fast!

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.900
And secure her.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:54.640
Birdy, the right word there is "protect."

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.410
Maybe I should hide her at my place...

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:59.480
She's the Ryunka.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:02.540
Nakasugi's been infected by the Ryunka.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:07.950
The Ryunka is growing inside her.
She's <i>becoming</i> the Ryunka.

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:10.990
So I'll secure her.

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:12.660
Knock it off with the lame jokes.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.590
I'm not joking!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.930
Like I could believe that!
Do you even have any proof?!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:21.560
We found traces of the Ryunka in her sweat.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.960
When did you get her sweat?!

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:32.980
You... used me?

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:37.310
I'm sorry. But the Ryunka is
dangerous for this planet too!

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.940
If we let it go, the whole
human race could go ext...

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:53.500
So you'll kill her.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.930
You're going to kill Nakasugi, right?!

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.940
If I don't get rid of the Ryunka,
lots of people will die!

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:03.210
I know that!

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:09.450
But Nakasugi hasn't...
Nakasugi hasn't done anything wrong.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:15.020
Why... Why should she have to get killed?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.320
Don't cry.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.520
Please understand, Tsutomu.
It's to save a lot of lives!

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.950
No!

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:27.150
I know you're wrong! No way
is she the Ryunka. It's not true!

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.470
Look out!

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:33.800
Ow.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.740
Why is my body?

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:38.670
W-Wait, Tsutomu!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.510
I won't let you get to her!

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.340
Tsutomu!

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.500
Even if it wasn't deliberate,

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:04.090
Tsutomu Senkawa blocked
Birdy's will and controlled her body.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:16.750
You were showing
symptoms of mental fusion, Birdy.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.680
You had a close shave.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:20.920
Captain Megius!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.910
So you're finally awake?

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.720
Nechla...

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:32.090
She will now be cooperating
fully with the Divine Council.

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:33.460
I trust that's fine?

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.760
Do what she says, Birdy.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.300
Hold on, Sir!

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:41.070
I have a duty to protect
Tsutomu Senkawa's way of life!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.310
There's no longer any need for that.

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:45.930
What?

00:12:56.720 --> 00:13:00.090
Tsutomu?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.080
Tsutomu, are you okay?

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.300
Birdy? Birdy!

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.930
Huh? Huh?! <i>Huh?!</i>

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:12.970
Tsutomu...

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:16.240
We told you we would transport the body here.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:17.810
That doesn't mean you should just!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:20.610
I don't have time to waste
on pointless conversation.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.980
I'm going to secure the Ryunka
immediately and dispose of it.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.310
Nakasugi!

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:25.150
Tsutomu?!

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.580
Ow...

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.850
You go home.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:30.840
Huh?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.640
Ow!

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:37.860
Nakasugi!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.100
Clothes! Clothes!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:41.080
Ow!

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:44.370
Glasses! Glasses!

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.770
Why now?!

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:48.960
Coming! Just a second!

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:05.490
I didn't expect her to disappear.
Any clues as to where she went?

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:09.560
Would it be better to wait here
instead of searching at random?

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:12.290
It sounds like you don't
want to capture the Ryunka.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:18.000
Does the Divine Council really
not know a way to save the host?

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.370
Unfortunately we don't have any data on that.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.840
You're useless.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.460
No, <i>you</i> are.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:31.510
The Federation investigator?

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:35.420
Yes, though it looked like
there was someone else there.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:38.190
It may be best to get the
Ryunka sooner rather than later.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.180
No need to worry.

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:44.480
It will come to me.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.930
There are no mistakes in my methods.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.170
I'm sorry for bursting in on you like this.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:59.780
My relatives took my cell phone,
so I couldn't call you.

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.010
Am I a bother?

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:03.380
No, not at all.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:08.420
I'm so worried and lonely...
I can't believe Grandfather is dead.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.020
And now Yoshie...

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.360
I don't know what to do!

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:14.420
Nakasugi!

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.410
I...

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:20.600
Wait, where are they?

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:21.760
Oh, here!

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:22.970
Nakasugi.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:24.300
Thank you.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:27.940
For now, just catch your breath.
You can stay here, okay?

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:31.970
I'm sorry. I just felt relieved to see your face.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:34.970
So many people have
been in and out of the house...

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:39.750
Oh. Have they been acting nasty?

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.880
No. They're all kind.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:46.760
Even though I've never met any of
them before, they're all nice to me.

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:49.160
So nice it makes me sick.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.420
Hmm?

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.100
Hello.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.970
Tsutomu! Nakasugi's with you, isn't she?

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:02.400
No. She's not here.

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:05.010
I don't want to force her to come with me.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:07.440
Let me take care of her!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:08.840
Tsutomu?

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:15.620
You're going to dispose of the Ryunka, right?

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:19.120
The Ryunka is fused with Nakasugi now!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:23.330
If it manifests itself, the Tragedy
of Bilugeva will happen here!

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.790
All the humans will die!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.190
She's not the Ryunka!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.100
Tsutomu...

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:36.370
Looks like you failed to convince him.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.170
Nechla.

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:40.880
I'll tell you something.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.850
The Divine Council's elimination
of the Ryunka has been postponed.

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:44.950
What?

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:50.950
Infighting has begun in the
government over what to do with it.

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:55.960
It seems there are some who want to
make Earth a Ryunka testing ground.

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:58.890
A testing ground for lost technology.

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:05.170
In other words, they don't care
how many primitive natives die.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.640
Let's run away, Nakasugi!

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:07.570
What?

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:14.180
Um... Well... You don't like the
people around you now, right?

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.340
Right...

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:18.150
You can't be around people like that.

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:20.180
Run away somewhere with me!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.480
As far away from here as we can.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.880
Senkawa...

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.890
Nakasugi! Come on, quick.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.110
It kind of feels like we're fugitives, huh?

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.070
- Huh?
- Where should we go?

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:47.440
Um...

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:50.080
North? Or how about south?

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.580
Hmm, good question.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:54.920
Maybe the end of the world?

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.020
We don't have passports...

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.750
So you're really serious.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:17:59.550
Huh?

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.120
I'm glad.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.860
Yeah...

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:06.260
Let's run around the world robbing banks!

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:07.800
We'll always have money that way.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.630
You're kidding.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.400
Let's practice running, then!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.100
Hey, wait!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.070
Come on, run!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.470
Nakasugi!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:29.920
Nakasugi!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.150
We're like Bonnie and Clyde.

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:33.220
Who are they?

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:37.930
People in an old movie. A couple
traveling together, robbing banks.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:40.930
Huh. What happens to them?

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:44.300
They get shot by the police and they both die.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:45.730
Huh.

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.570
Would you be okay with dying, if it were with me?

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:49.910
Huh?

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:51.910
Oh, it's no good.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:52.910
What isn't?

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:55.980
If you can't answer right away,
I don't have high hopes for you.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:19:00.580
But it's okay. I'll be a
human shield and protect you.

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:06.290
